    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA # d5 Super-App Port — Full Report
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA Goal: merge everything under `!Coding-Enviroment` into the single `d5` web
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA app without deleting any feature or app. Status at write time: implementation
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA complete, statically verified, **not yet browser-tested** (see Blockers).
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ## 1. Scope inventory (what was found)
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA - **76 git repos** under `!Coding-Enviroment` (already merged into `projects/`
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA in an earlier session, histories preserved via subtree).
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA - **73 additional non-git project folders** (plain folders, no `.git`):
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA games (2048, snake, ping pong, …), websites, PHP apps, learning exercises,
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA Minecraft plugins, Python tools. These were **not** in `projects/` yet.
