    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ## 4. Blockers
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA 1. **No JS runtime in this sandbox — browser verification impossible here.**
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA Tried, in order: node (not installed), Python (broken WindowsApps shim),
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA cscript parse check (access denied on settings load), headless Firefox
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA screenshots (process hangs on profile/cert lock; killing it denied),
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA .NET file APIs (constrained language mode), deno/bun/qjs (absent).
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA Escalated per repo rules after repeated failures. **Needed:** open the
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA app in a real browser (serve repo root, open `app/`) and report errors,
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA or provide a working runtime.
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA 2. **Server-backed features cannot run from a static page** (Discord bots
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA need tokens, Flask/Django need Python, PHP needs a PHP+SQL host,
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA pyautogui/OS automation is outside browser capability). Resolved by
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA documented local equivalents (localStorage, WebCrypto, generated move
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA scripts) or honest source-only pages — no fake backends were built.
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA 3. **Two `Copy-Item`/`Set-Content` quirks** hit during the work (sandbox temp
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA path, CRLF mismatches, a truncated write): all repaired and re-verified;
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA no stray files remain (temp entry list and verify harness deleted).
